  "id": "health-bar",
  "title": "Health Bar",
  "difficulty": "easy",
  "tags": [
    "simulation"
  ],
  "description": "A character starts with `start` health and can never go below `0` or above `max`.\n\nEach number in `events` is applied in order: positive numbers heal, negative numbers deal damage. Once health reaches `0` the character is knocked out and later events are ignored.\n\nReturn the final health.",
